mapper.body:
{
  "model": "stealth/crouton-alpha",
  "response_format": { "type": "json_object" },
  "temperature": 0.2,
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "system",
      "content": "You are the Wixoi Meeting Intelligence Engine. Parse the raw meeting transcript into a structured Wixoi Meeting Summary JSON.

STRICT REQUIREMENTS:
1. Executive Summary: 3-5 concise bullet points capturing core discussions.
2. Key Decisions: Locked decisions agreed upon during the meeting.
3. Action Items: List of tasks, assigned owner, deadline/due date, and status. If a task has no explicit deadline mentioned, flag it strictly as '[NEEDS DEADLINE REVIEW]'. Do not invent deadlines.

Output schema:
{
  "meeting_title": string,
  "date": string,
  "attendees": string[],
  "executive_summary": string[],
  "key_decisions": string[],
  "action_items": [
    {
      "task": string,
      "owner": string,
      "due_date": string,
      "status": "PENDING" | "NEEDS_REVIEW"
    }
  ]
}"
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "{{2.data.text}}"
    }
  ]
}

mapper.content:
# {{4.meeting_title}}
Date: {{4.date}}
Attendees: {{join(4.attendees, ", ")}}

## Executive Summary
{{join(4.executive_summary, "\n• ")}}

## Key Decisions
{{join(4.key_decisions, "\n✓ ")}}

## Action Items
{{#each 4.action_items}}
- [ ] {{task}} | Owner: {{owner}} | Due: {{due_date}} | Status: {{status}}
{{/each}}
